<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia prices steady, trade slow.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia prices steady, trade slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP and ammonia were little changed on Wednesday. Dealers noted, however, prices in the ammonia market could be poised to ease shortly due to weakness in the world market. DAP trade remained slow.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-178		    unch</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188			  unch</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   218-220		    unch</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
